🐛 Describe the bug
Hello. I'm trying to save and load the checkpoints with libtorch. torch::save seems to work normally. But when I try to load the model parameters with torch::load, a c10::error always raises:
int main(int argc, char* argv[]) {
	int dim = 200;
	int C = 41;
	int hidden_size = 100;
	int L = 5;
	auto net = GnnModelUndirected(dim, C, hidden_size, L);
	std::ifstream in("19_0.7486_ 0.7550.pt");
	torch::load(net, in);                        //error raises here
	std::ofstream out("./params.txt");
	out << net->parameters();
	return 0;
}
